# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NEON DRIFT — 3D Racing Engine (sub-project)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Neon Drift has its own build system and structure.
# It is integrated into Mario GTA6's website as the racing mode.
# The neon-drift/index.html is a standalone build artifact.
neon-drift/index.html
neon-drift/index.html.legacy
# Keep: neon-drift/js/, neon-drift/css/, neon-drift/build.py, neon-drift/assets/
# Keep: neon-drift/.github/ (CI/CD for Neon Drift releases)
rust/target/
